 n←{parms}∆DisplayButtons(text buttons);globalGuiParms
⍝ Presents any number of buttons together with a message.
 globalGuiParms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 globalGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 globalGuiParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 parms←{0=⎕NC ⍵:#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Dialogs.CreateParmsForDisplayButtons ⋄ ⍎⍵}'parms'
 n←globalGuiParms parms #.APLGUI.APLGUI.Dialogs.CreateDisplayButtons text buttons
⍝Done
